(text "ESP32-S3FH4R2: in-package 4MB flash + 2MB PSRAM, both Quad-SPI.\nPackage pins 28 and 30-35 reserved/NC; enlarged 5.7mm exposed pad.\nGPIO16 / GPIO17 drive 5V buffers; GPIO18 senses the shared BOOT button." (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "1329b8c0-1d51-5cfc-a348-796c7e9050c5"))
